  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">🏛️ <strong>試煉與尾巴+（建築結構）</strong></span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>試煉與尾巴+</strong></span> 將經典的 Minecraft 建築改造成全新的 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>試煉密室挑戰！</strong></span><br>探索 9 個重新設計的地牢，靈感來自世界上最著名的地標——如今已為試煉時代重建。</h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">💎 <strong>遊戲玩法</strong></span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">每個改造後的建築都擁有：</h1><ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li>\n<h1>自訂的 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>試煉生怪磚</strong></span></h1>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h1>主題化的 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>戰利品池</strong></span></h1>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h1>動態的 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>照明與陷阱</strong></span></h1>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h1>手工打造的佈局，專為平衡戰鬥與探索而設計</h1>\n</li>\n</ul><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">非常適合喜歡經典風格冒險內容並帶有新意的玩家。</h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">感謝 @tessabaarsdrecht 的模組點子！Discord 成員</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1363/776/trial_mansion_optimized_1000-png.png\" alt=\" mansion\" width=\"2149\" height=\"1095\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1363/778/trial_mansion_entrance_optimized_1000-png.png\" alt=\"入口\" width=\"2142\" height=\"1100\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1363/774/trial_witch_hut_optimized_1000-png.png\" alt=\"試煉女巫小屋\" width=\"2134\" height=\"1104\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1363/770/trial_ocean_temple_optimized_1000-png.png\" alt=\"水下神殿\" width=\"2138\" height=\"1102\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f9UWsTm2svK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" alt=\"discord\" width=\"394\" height=\"115\"></a></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">加入 Discord 以獲取更新與錯誤回報（更快的支援）</span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">想要更多模組嗎？我們有超過 60 個模組等著你！點擊下方連結 <img src=\"https://static-cdn.jtvnw.net/jtv_user_pictures/0210b039-e874-4d2e-8b05-d839d92d13fe-profile_image-150x150.png\" alt=\"smart\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/smartstreamlabs/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/members/smartstreamlabs/project</a></span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/smartstreamlabs/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">s</a></span></h1><p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1363/789/0_y-oziz8kkcaojtqp-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"trails\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/868/290/intellij-idea-icon-512x512-ksbwsbbn.png\" alt=\"intelij\" width=\"253\" height=\"253\"></span></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">此模組使用 IntelliJ 建立</span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">#無關贊助</span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">免責聲明：本產品非官方 Minecraft 產品。未經 Mojang 或微軟批准或與其相關</span></h1>",
